Checker mappings in data/checker_map.json
-----------------------------------------
Derived from (facts only: checker names and rule IDs):
  * CodeChecker label files (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/Ericsson/codechecker
  * LLVM clang-tidy cert-* aliases (Apache-2.0 with LLVM exceptions),
    https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project
The exact commits are recorded in the file itself.
